  "lessons": [
    "The 2018 node signed only the ciphertext, so a record's name, hash and level could be changed on the way. The rewrite signs the whole record.",
    "Receiving any chain used to empty the mempool and lose queued records. Now only mined transactions leave, and ones dropped in a reorg are rechecked.",
    "Rust's rsa crate has an unfixed timing advisory (RUSTSEC-2023-0071), bad news for a node that decrypts for others all day, so the rewrite uses X25519."
  ],
